#: ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:90
msgid "connect_timeout_ms"
msgstr "connect_timeout_ms"

#: ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:92
msgid ""
"**Type:** `int`   **Default Value:** `5000`   **Description:**   The "
"timeout duration for connection operations, measured in milliseconds. If "
"a successful connection cannot be established within this time, the "
"connection operation will fail."
msgstr ""
"**类型：** `int`  <br>"
"**默认值：** `5000`  <br>"
"**说明：**  <br>"
"连接操作的超时时间，单位为毫秒。如果在此时间内未能成功建立连接，连接操作将失败。"

#: ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:97 ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:127
msgid "**Limitations:**"
msgstr "**限制：**"

#: ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:98 ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:128
msgid "Minimum value: 500ms"
msgstr "最小值：500ms"

#: ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:99
msgid "Recommended value: 3000-10000ms, depending on network environment"
msgstr "建议值：3000-10000ms，取决于网络环境"

#: ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:103
msgid "auto_reconnect"
msgstr "auto_reconnect"

#: ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:105
msgid ""
"**Type:** `bool`   **Default Value:** `false`   **Description:**   "
"Whether to enable auto-reconnection. When enabled, if the connection "
"unexpectedly disconnects, the SDK will automatically attempt to "
"reconnect."
msgstr ""
"**类型：** `bool`  <br>"
"**默认值：** `false`  <br>"
"**说明：**  <br>"
"是否启用自动重连功能。当启用时，如果连接意外断开，SDK 将自动尝试重新连接。"

#: ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:110
msgid "**Behavior:**"
msgstr "**行为：**"

#: ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:111
msgid ""
"`false`: Auto-reconnection disabled; connection must be reestablished by "
"manually calling `Connect()`"
msgstr "`false`: 禁用自动重连，连接断开后需手动调用 `Connect()`"

#: ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:112
msgid ""
"`true`: Auto-reconnection enabled; SDK automatically attempts to "
"reconnect on unexpected disconnection"
msgstr "`true`: 启用自动重连，连接断开后 SDK 自动尝试重连"

#: ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:114
msgid "**Note:**"
msgstr "**注意：**"

#: ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:115
msgid ""
"Auto-reconnection is only triggered on unexpected disconnection, not on "
"intentional `Disconnect()` calls"
msgstr "自动重连仅在意外断开时触发，主动调用 `Disconnect()` 不会触发重连"

#: ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:116
msgid ""
"During reconnection attempts, the connection state is "
"`ConnectionState::RECONNECTING`"
msgstr "重连期间连接状态为 `ConnectionState::RECONNECTING`"

#: ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:120
msgid "reconnect_interval_ms"
msgstr "reconnect_interval_ms"

#: ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:122
msgid ""
"**Type:** `int`   **Default Value:** `1000`   **Description:**   The "
"interval time for auto-reconnection attempts, measured in milliseconds. "
"Only effective when `auto_reconnect` is `true`."
msgstr ""
"**类型：** `int`  <br>"
"**默认值：** `1000`  <br>"
"**说明：**  <br>"
"自动重连的间隔时间，单位为毫秒。仅在 `auto_reconnect` 为 `true` 时有效。"

#: ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:129
msgid "Recommended value: 1000-5000ms"
msgstr "建议值：1000-5000ms"

