#: ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md
msgid "UDP protocol"
msgstr "UDP 协议"

#: ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:151
msgid "**Use Cases:**"
msgstr "**使用场景：**"

#: ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:152
msgid ""
"**WebSocket**: Suitable for most scenarios, providing reliable "
"bidirectional communication"
msgstr "**WebSocket**: 适用于大多数场景，提供可靠的双向通信"

#: ../../source/3.1SDK_Connection.md:153
msgid ""
"**UDP**: Suitable for low-latency scenarios, but does not guarantee data "
"reliability"
msgstr "**UDP**: 适用于低延迟场景，但不保证数据可靠性"

